<title>INDIA: India SmithKline Beecham meets for bonus.</title>
<headline>India SmithKline Beecham meets for bonus.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's SmithKline Beecham Consumer Healthcare Ltd will meet later on Tuesday to consider an equity share bonus issue, the Bombay Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>SmithKline Beecham Consumer Healthcare is a subsidiary of SmithKline Beecham Plc of U.K. It Horlicks brand is a leader in the Indian health drinks market.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
